<title>USA: Ceridian to repurchase additional shares.</title>
<headline>Ceridian to repurchase additional shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceridian Corp said Wednesday its board of directors authorized the company to repurchase up to an additional three millon shares of common stock in open-market or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>This supplements a repurchase program authorized in 1994 and under which approximately one million shares may still be purchased.  </p>
<p>Ceridian said purchases will be made from time to time depending on share price and market conditions.</p>
<p>As of May 31, it had approximately 80.7 million shares of common stock issued and outstanding.</p>
<p>Ceridian is an information services and defense electronics company.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
